---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="项目" currentPath="/projects">
  <slot name="head">
    <style>
      .page { padding: 3rem 0; }
      .page h1 { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }

      .project-list { display: grid; gap: 1.25rem; }
      .project-card {
        display: block;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        padding: 1.5rem;
        text-decoration: none;
        color: inherit;
        transition: box-shadow 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;
      }
      .project-card:hover {
        box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      .project-card h2 { font-size: 1.125rem; margin: 0 0 0.3rem; }
      .project-card .meta { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.4rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
      .project-card p { font-size: 0.875rem; color: var(--text-secondary); margin: 0; line-height: 1.6; }
      .project-card .status { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.5rem; }
    </style>
  </slot>

  <div class="page fade-in">
    <div class="content-container">
      <h1>项目</h1>
      <div class="project-list">
        <a href="/projects/embedded-lab/" class="project-card">
          <div class="meta">
            <span class="tag">STM32F407</span>
            <span class="tag">C</span>
            <span class="tag">UART</span>
            <span class="tag">SysTick</span>
          </div>
          <h2>串口命令控制 LED 系统</h2>
          <p>基于 STM32F407 的非阻塞 LED 控制系统。串口命令实时控制 LED 颜色与模式，三层模块化架构（BSP/App/User），UART 中断 + 环形缓冲区 FIFO，SysTick 非阻塞延时。</p>
          <div class="status">嵌入式工程实验室 · 持续建设中</div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
